A) \mathbf{B}(r, t) points along \hat{\mathbf{r}} with magnitude  rac{\mu_0 V_0 r}{2d a} \cos(\omega t); wire current is  rac{\epsilon_0 V_0 \omega}{d} \cos(\omega t); \mathbf{K}(r, t) =  rac{V_0 \omega}{2 d r} \cos(\omega t) \hat{\mathbf{r}}
