In a particle collider, two beams each consist of \( n \) bunches circulating and making head-on collisions. Each bunch contains \( N_1 \) and \( N_2 \) particles, respectively. If the cross-sectional area of each beam is \( A \), and the circulation frequency is \( f \), which of the following expressions correctly gives the total luminosity \( L \) in terms of these parameters?

